[{"id":165182459,"discussion_id":"fafb8a508cdf3fad6ff30c0788897d1e21beeba9","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conversion/im2col | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhanw_coding, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-13T15:04:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T17:01:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165182480,"discussion_id":"f1bc2ef3cf604f266beb561ad5c3dab0d27be17e","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-13T15:04:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T15:04:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165182778,"discussion_id":"346d883b73e4a81f31b1ed49e0211e8913bcfd12","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-13T15:05:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T15:05:30+08:00","user":{"id":"68d10be46073b92eb7722836","login":"zhanw_coding","object_id":"68d10be46073b92eb7722836","name":"zhanw_coding","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/af/1b59fa26fc66d8f2fb2c2ae63bb567faa986617b7b8600ad716afe7696d65511.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhanw_coding"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165182933,"discussion_id":"ec7caca8fefd56df2ba1884768cdf61cfd2540f6","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了Im2col算子（NCHW格式）在特定左填充（padding）场景下，tiling计算中用于估算输入缓冲区大小的`NCHWCalcBufSize`和`CheckUnFullLoadBuf`函数存在的逻辑缺陷。原逻辑在计算包含左填充的输入长度和缓冲区需求时不够完善，可能导致返回负值、无效值或分配不足的缓冲区，进而引发后续内存分配错误、数据访问越界或计算错误。本次修改增强了相关计算逻辑的健壮性和准确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n主要修改包含两部分：1. 在`NCHWCalcBufSize`函数中，增加了对关键中间变量`inputW`的合法性检查（若小于等于0则返回预定义的无效值`NCHW_INVALID_BUFFER`并记录警告），并重构了计算最大对齐输入长度的逻辑，以更准确地处理跨左填充边界的场景。2. 在`CheckUnFullLoadBuf`函数中，修正了非满载模式下的输入缓冲区需求计算逻辑，通过迭代分析左填充区域内所有可能的加载窗口起始位置，动态计算被分割的填充部分和有效数据部分所需的对齐缓冲区大小，并取最大值作为最终需求，从而确保缓冲区充足。同时新增了单元测试以验证修复效果。","created_at":"2026-03-13T15:06:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T15:06:22+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165182935,"discussion_id":"ee92aa7a99d06cd7c51adf9ca98bcb30066cb484","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=baa35b32363740f6b9f96